 school_change_blocked:{zh:'学校稿变更仍有不可忽略的问题，原稿与本次输入均已保留，请核对差异预览。',en:'The school manuscript change still has blocking issues. The original manuscript and input are retained. Review the difference preview.'},
 school_change_invalid:{zh:'学校稿变更输入或操作无效，请核对所选父稿和确认版本。',en:'The school manuscript change input or operation is invalid. Review the selected parent manuscript and confirmed version.'},
 school_change_preview_conflict:{zh:'学校稿差异预览已变化，请重新查看并确认。',en:'The school manuscript difference preview has changed. Review and confirm it again.'},
 school_export_input_invalid:{zh:'学校稿导出输入或固定排版配置无效，请核对章节与导出选项；启用目录时须有可放置目录的正文入口。',en:'The school manuscript export input or saved layout configuration is invalid. Review chapters and export options; when the table of contents is enabled, an eligible body section for its placement is required.'},
 storage_deletion_idempotency_conflict:{zh:'同一处置标识与原确认不一致，请核对原计划与确认。',en:'The disposal identifier does not match the original confirmation. Review the original plan and confirmation.'},
 storage_deletion_identity_changed:{zh:'登记对象的存储身份无法核实，对象已保留，请核对处置记录。',en:'The registered storage identity cannot be verified. The object is retained. Review the disposal record.'},
 storage_deletion_input_invalid:{zh:'处置输入无效，请核对范围、理由及确认。',en:'The disposal input is invalid. Review the scope, reason and confirmation.'},
 storage_deletion_io_failed:{zh:'处置对象时读写失败，请核对原处置状态后再处理。',en:'An input/output error occurred while disposing of an object. Check the original disposal status before continuing.'},
