figure_projection_invalid_group:{zh:'显示分组必须覆盖原相关的全部有效记录，不允许静默删点。',en:'Display groups must cover every valid correlation record; points cannot be silently removed.'},
figure_projection_duplicate_x:{zh:'同组同横轴存在重复记录，请明确选择均值聚合或修订数据。',en:'Repeated X values occur within a group. Explicitly choose mean aggregation or revise the data.'},
figure_projection_invalid_numeric:{zh:'数值字段包含非法值，不会自动转换。',en:'The numeric field contains invalid values; no automatic conversion is performed.'},
figure_projection_invalid_category:{zh:'分类字段包含不支持的类型或标签。',en:'The category field contains unsupported types or labels.'},
figure_projection_invalid_datetime:{zh:'时间横轴需要合法日期或日期时间，不使用行序推断时间。',en:'The time axis requires valid dates or date-times; row order is not interpreted as time.'},
figure_projection_invalid_x_type:{zh:'请明确横轴为数值、时间或有序类别。',en:'Specify a numeric, temporal or ordered-category X axis.'},
figure_projection_ordered_x_required:{zh:'有序类别须提供完整顺序并覆盖所有纳入值。',en:'Provide an explicit category order covering every included value.'},
figure_projection_projection_empty:{zh:'按所选规则没有可绘制的有效记录。',en:'No valid plottable records remain under the selected rules.'},
figure_projection_projection_limit:{zh:'投影记录或分组超过当前支持范围，请缩小明确选区。',en:'Projection records or groups exceed the supported range. Reduce the explicit selection.'},
figure_projection_violin_unsupported_group:{zh:'小提琴图每组至少需 3 条有效记录且方差大于 0；可主动选择箱线图。',en:'A violin plot requires at least 3 valid records and positive variance in each group. Consider choosing a box plot.'},
